# Line-ending policy for this repo.
# Ross edits from Windows (PowerShell) and Claude from WSL (Linux). Without this
# file, Windows git converts files to CRLF on checkout and Linux git then sees
# every file as modified. "eol=lf" forces Unix line endings in the working tree
# on both sides, which Ruby scripts and shell tools expect anyway.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.sqlite3 binary
